e Inquiry\u0027, \u0027Waive Fee\u0027). Frame structure: top \u2192 hdrFrm / navFrm / wrkFrm, with the module injected into the nested wrkFrm\u003EmodFrm several seconds after clicking the nav item \u2014 always wait for #ext-gen42_input to exist. The nav tree starts collapsed: \u0027Account Servicing\u0027 must be expanded by clicking the \u002B/- toggle span (#ext-gen89); clicking the group label div (#ext-gen88) alone did not expand it, and Fee Management is not clickable while collapsed. Two distinct busy indicators share id #loading-spinner inside wrkFrm\u003EmodFrm (\u0027Legacy host communication in progress...\u0027 for inquiry, \u0027Posting reversal to host...\u0027 for the waive) \u2014 always wait for state=absent before reading results. The security override modal escapes the module frame and is rendered in the TOP document. The flow waives the single assessed fee row shown (OVERDRAFT ITEM FEE); if a future account lists multiple fee rows there will be multiple \u0027Waive Fee\u0027 controls and the row selection would need to be made explicit."}}
